OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and light rain initially
OL,6,Fwhich clears early to mid-morning.
OL,7,FOtherwise a day of sunny spells and a
OL,8,Ffew isolated light showers, most of
OL,9,Fthese confined to Dumfries and
OL,10,FGalloway.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry with clear spells
OL,13,Fmost widespread in the east, but a few
OL,14,Fscattered light showers appearing
OL,15,Facross Dumfries and Galloway.
OL,16,FSouthwest winds freshening overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
