OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FMost staying dry with best
OL,6,Fof the brighter spells appearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning and towards the
OL,8,Feast coast. Isolated showers over
OL,9,FDumfries and Galloway, building late
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FIsolated
OL,13,Fshowers Sunday morning, then periods
OL,14,Fof rain for afternoon. Most dry and
OL,15,Foccasionally bright on Monday. Tuesday
OL,16,Fturning wet and windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
